{"task_id": "Mbpp/2", "solution": "def find_shared_elements(list1, list2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the shared elements between two lists.\n\n    Args:\n        list1: The first list.\n        list2: The second list.\n\n    Returns:\n        A set containing the elements present in both lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    set1 = set(list1)\n    set2 = set(list2)\n    shared_elements = set1.intersection(set2)\n    return shared_elements"}
