{"task_id": "Mbpp/18", "solution": "def remove_chars(source_string: str, removal_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Removes characters from the first string that are present in the second string.\n\n    Args:\n        source_string: The string from which characters will be removed.\n        removal_string: The string containing characters to be removed.\n\n    Returns:\n        A new string with characters removed.\n    \"\"\"\n    removal_set = set(removal_string)\n    result_list = []\n    for char in source_string:\n        if char not in removal_set:\n            result_list.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result_list)\n\nassert remove_chars(\"probasscurve\", \"pros\") == 'bacuve'"}
