{"task_id": "Mbpp/227", "solution": "def find_minimum(a: float, b: float, c: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum of three numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        a: The first number.\n        b: The second number.\n        c: The third number.\n\n    Returns:\n        The minimum of a, b, and c.  Returns None if input is invalid.\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        a = float(a)\n        b = float(b)\n        c = float(c)\n    except ValueError:\n        return None  # Or raise a TypeError\n\n    minimum = a\n    if b < minimum:\n        minimum = b\n    if c < minimum:\n        minimum = c\n    return minimum\ndef min_of_three(a,b,c):\n    return find_minimum(a,b,c)"}
