{"task_id": "Mbpp/255", "solution": "def combinations_with_repetition(elements: list, n: int) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates all combinations with repetition of elements from a given list.\n\n    Args:\n        elements: A list of elements to choose from.\n        n: The length of each combination.\n\n    Returns:\n        A list of tuples, where each tuple is a combination with repetition.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return [()]\n    if not elements:\n        return []\n\n    result = []\n    for i in range(len(elements)):\n        first = elements[i]\n        remaining_combinations = combinations_with_repetition(elements, n - 1)\n        for combination in remaining_combinations:\n            result.append((first,) + combination)  # Create a new tuple\n\n    return result"}
