{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a list into sublists based on the given interval n.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list: The list to split.\n        n: The interval for splitting the list.\n\n    Returns:\n        A list of lists, where each inner list contains elements from the\n        original list selected at intervals of n.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If input_list is not a list or n is not an integer.\n        ValueError: If n is zero or negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"input_list must be a list\")\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an integer\")\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be greater than zero\")\n\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for i in range(len(input_list)):\n        sublist_index = i % n\n        result[sublist_index].append(input_list[i])\n\n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/266", "solution": "def lateralsurface_cube(side_length: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the lateral surface area of a cube.\n\n    Args:\n        side_length: The length of a side of the cube.\n\n    Returns:\n        The lateral surface area of the cube.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If side_length is not a number.\n        ValueError: If side_length is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(side_length, (int, float)):\n        raise TypeError(\"side_length must be a number.\")\n    if side_length < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"side_length must be non-negative.\")\n\n    lateral_surface_area = 4 * side_length * side_length\n    return lateral_surface_area"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def sum_of_squares_of_odd_numbers(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n: A positive integer representing the number of odd natural numbers to consider.\n\n    Returns:\n        The sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If the input is not an integer.\n        ValueError: If the input is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be an integer.\")\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    sum_squares = 0\n    odd_number = 1\n    count = 0\n\n    while count < n:\n        sum_squares += odd_number ** 2\n        count += 1\n        odd_number += 2\n\n    return sum_squares"}
