{"task_id": "Mbpp/300", "solution": "import math\ndef count_binary_seq(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the number of binary sequences of length 2n where the sum of the first n bits\n    equals the sum of the last n bits.\n\n    Args:\n        n: A positive integer representing half the length of the binary sequence.\n\n    Returns:\n        The calculated count as an integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        combinations = math.comb(n, k)\n        count += combinations * combinations\n    return count"}
