{"task_id": "Mbpp/311", "solution": "def set_left_most_unset_bit(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds and sets the leftmost unset bit in an integer.\n\n    Args:\n        n: A non-negative integer.\n\n    Returns:\n        The integer with the leftmost unset bit set.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    msb = 1\n    while msb <= n:\n        msb <<= 1\n\n    while msb > 0:\n        msb >>= 1\n        if (n & msb) == 0:\n            return n | msb\n    return msb << 1"}
