{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n: A positive integer representing the number of natural numbers.\n\n    Returns:\n        The average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers (float).\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes = sum_of_cubes + (i * i * i)\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return float(average)"}
