{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sum_of_even_factors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even factors of a given number.\n\n    Args:\n      n: A positive integer.\n\n    Returns:\n      The sum of the even factors of n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        return 0  # Or raise TypeError or ValueError\n\n    sum_even_factors = 0\n    for i in range(1, int(n**0.5) + 1): #iterate only to the square root of n for efficiency\n      if n % i == 0:\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n          sum_even_factors += i\n        if i * i != n: #avoid adding the same factor twice if n is a perfect square\n          other_factor = n // i\n          if other_factor % 2 == 0:\n            sum_even_factors += other_factor\n\n    return sum_even_factors"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/454", "solution": "import re\ndef text_match_wordz(text: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a given string contains a word with the letter 'z' (case-insensitive).\n\n    Args:\n        text: The string to check.\n\n    Returns:\n        True if the string contains a word with 'z', False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not text:\n        return False\n    text = text.lower()\n    words = re.findall(r'\\b\\w+\\b', text)  # Split into words using regex\n    for word in words:\n        if 'z' in word:\n            return True\n    return False"}
