{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(data, positions):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a list to the right by a specified number of positions.\n\n    Args:\n        data: The list to rotate.\n        positions: The number of positions to rotate to the right.\n\n    Returns:\n        A new list that is the right-rotated version of the input list.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not data:\n        return []\n\n    k = positions % len(data)\n    return data[-k:] + data[:-k]"}
